    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "*** A STUNNING FOUR BEDROOM (THREE BATHROOM) SEMI-DETACHED FAMILY HOME, A3 ENERGY RATING WITH SOLAR PANELS, HIGHLY SOUGHT-AFTER \"CROSFORGE\", SHORT STROLL TO SAGGART VILLAGE, LUAS AND THE CITYWEST SHOPPING CENTRE, HIGH-SPEC FINISH THROUGHOUT, BRIGHT AND SPACIOUS LIVING ACOOMODATION OF APPROX 1,350 SQ FT, LARGE GARDEN AND TWO PARKING SPACES***\n\nByrne Malone Estate Agents are delighted to present 69 Crosforge to the market. This stunning four bedroom (three bathroom) family home is ideally located on the highly sought-after \"Crosforge\" development. All local amenities are close by (Local shops, Dunnes Stores, great schools, parks and leisure facilities) with Saggart Village, Citywest Shopping Centre, Avoca, Rathcoole Village and LUAS all within walking distance. The N7, N81 and M50 are just minutes away by car. \n\nThis modern, bright and very spacious property comes to the market in excellent condition throughout and comprises to the ground floor a sitting room, a fabulous, open-plan kitchen/diner opening onto the rear garden, utility room and cloakroom/W.C. Upstairs are four bedrooms with en-suite to main bedroom and a family bathroom. \n\nTo the rear is a great size garden and to the front a cobble-lock driveway providing off-street parking for two cars and an EV charger. \n\nMany additional benefits include full double glazing throughout, 12, newly installed solar panels, gas-fired heating system, integrated appliances, fitted wardrobes and alarm.\nTo view this exceptional home please call us on 01 912 5500"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
        "SortOrder": 3,
        "Content": "A STUNNING FOUR BEDROOM (THREE BATHROOM) FAMILY HOME\nA3 ENERGY RATING WITH 12 RECENTLY INSTALLED SOLAR PANELS\nHIGHLY SOUGHT-AFTER 'CROSFORGE'\nSHORT STROLL TO SAGGART VILLAGE, RATHCOOLE VILLAGE, LUAS AND CITYWEST SHOPPING CENTRE\nMODERN, BRIGHT AND VERY SPACIOUS LIVING ACOOMODATION OF 1,350 SQ FT\nHIGH-SPEC FINISH THROUGHOUT\nLARGE GARDEN, TWO PARKING SPACES AND EV CHARGER"
